{
  "name": "Post a daily ComfyUI photo from Google Sheets to Instagram and X by API and to Bluesky with an AI agent on a cloud phone",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1f0c9d2-0b6e-4c11-9a51-3f7e2d1c0a01",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 1160,
        "content": "## Daily AI character photo: your ComfyUI workflow → Instagram, X and Bluesky\n\n@[youtube](uWoa948iCwE)\n\nPrefer reading? [Written guide](https://nevermanual.cloud/blog/run-comfyui-workflow-from-n8n).\n\nOne new photo a day from your own ComfyUI workflow, posted to three networks with captions in your character's voice, through Never Manual's Studio and Slate.\n\n### How it works\n1. Every morning: the next scene marked `new` in your Google Sheet.\n2. **Prompt and LoRAs** builds the prompt and sets LoRA strengths.\n3. **Studio** runs your ComfyUI workflow (here Krea 2 + character and realism LoRAs) on a GPU.\n4. **Slate** queues it for Instagram and X by API, and for Bluesky in the real app on a cloud phone, physical or virtual. Each account captions it in its own voice. Posts go out at once or at the account's posting times; *Hold for Review* lets you approve first.\n5. The row is marked `posted` with the Media ID, post IDs and cost.\n\nNo `new` row: nothing runs. A failed node leaves the row `new` for the next run. A post that fails later shows in Slate, not here.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified community node `n8n-nodes-nevermanual` (tested 0.1.1, n8n 2.47).\n2. Sign up at nevermanual.cloud; add an API key as the Never Manual credential.\n3. In Studio, import the [ComfyUI workflow file](https://github.com/nevermanual/n8n-nodes-nevermanual/blob/main/templates/daily-character-photo/Krea%202%20Kiki%20%2B%20realism.json); its models load by themselves.\n4. In Slate, connect Instagram and X. For Bluesky (its rules allow automation), add a cloud phone with the app and a photo-post preset. Give each account an Autofill voice.\n5. [Copy the scenes sheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1F0Hlt7Qnklh0ceR3JaP79trpDQemQc7Rdoh841gIGdo/copy), connect Google Sheets and pick it in both Sheets nodes.\n6. Pick your Studio workflow and an account in each Post node.\n\n### Customization\nPick any ComfyUI workflow of yours in the Studio node and edit **Prompt and LoRAs**. Drop networks you don't need or swap Sheets for n8n Data tables."
      }
    },
