      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 290,
        "height": 470,
        "content": "## Bluesky: the real app on a cloud phone\nNo API: an AI agent posts in the Bluesky app on a Never Manual cloud phone, physical or virtual, by the account's **preset**.\nWrite presets for any app and action, or show the steps once on the phone."
